{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S06、S13等段的感受文字明显偏密，部分意思反复解释，扫读时容易占用听音乐的注意力，Y在快速获取概览上更轻松。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的双栏排法更容易快速扫到故事和情绪关键词，但不少短词只是并列标签，音乐变化与人物心理之间的联系需要观众自己补足。X虽然阅读负担较大，却通过重点字突出、叙事分层和随乐句出现的感受，把人物为什么想念、为什么抗拒、为什么犹豫以及后来如何改变交代得更具体，前后情绪也有更清楚的呼应。综合来看，X更能让普通观众获得完整、细腻且连贯的理解。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d9db4b47-2ade-43eb-aa04-c995109e4e98", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T041608698987Z", "elapsed_seconds": 53.5, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T04:17:02.213104+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "dbfc476408caf0e5cc8fe90bc0cf859095bd85b6f0c5b4da14199083bfd5ec5d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachmen